# 두 제품 폴더와 이 설정만 추적하고 루트의 작업 메모·백업은 PC에 보관해요.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/backend/
!/frontend/

# 안내 문서는 로컬에서 읽고 GitHub에는 코드만 올려요.
*.[mM][dD]

# Android
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/app/build/
**/local.properties

# iOS
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/.symlinks/
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.podspec
**/ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
**/ios/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/Runner.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/
**/*.xcuserstate
**/*.xcuserdatad

# Web
**/web/.dart_tool/

# Desktop
**/linux/build/
**/windows/build/
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/

# IDE / OS
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Environment
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
